Section 4.1: FastAPI Routing and Pydantic Request Parsing

FastAPI uses OpenAPI and Pydantic for high-performance schema serialization and deserialization:
    from fastapi import FastAPI, Path, HTTPException
    from pydantic import BaseModel, Field

    class ItemPayload(BaseModel):
        name: str = Field(..., min_length=2, max_length=50)
        price: float = Field(..., gt=0.0)

    @app.post('/items/{item_id}')
    async def create_item(item_id: int = Path(..., ge=1), payload: ItemPayload = ...):
        return {'id': item_id, 'data': payload.dict()}
